<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble falls to 14,750 in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble falls to 14,750 in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble has fallen to 14,750 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange - 14,700 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 7	     October 4</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    14,750		  14,700</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.128 million	    $2.596 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
